          "text": "External vulval examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Multiple 2–4 mm soft, skin-coloured/verrucous papules, approximately 6–8, on the labia minora and posterior introitus; non-tender; no ulceration or vesicles."
      }
    },
